{
    "title": "Going: Find Flight Deals",
    "description": "Find travel deals, the cheapest flights and reimagine your next trip with the ultimate vacation travel app. Going lets you discover your next destination \u2014 whether it\u2019s a quick trip or a dream getaway. With affordable flights to over 900 travel destinations around the world, the vacations are endless!\r\n\r\nSave up to 40-90% off flights from your city. No matter where you want to go, Going will help you find flight deals or cheap flights for your next vacation. Explore different travel deals to find flights that work best for you and your budget.\r\n\r\nGOING FEATURES\r\n\r\nFLIGHT DEALS & CHEAP FLIGHTS FOR VACATIONS\r\n- Domestic flights can be affordable! Discover the cheapest flights that will help you save on your next getaway\r\n- International travel is easy with our in-app globe. Find deals for specific domestic & international destinations\r\n- Travel without breaking the bank \u2014 get up to 90% off your next flight\r\n\r\nTRAVEL DEALS & AFFORDABLE FLIGHTS TO TOP DESTINATIONS\r\n- Intuitively find travel deals and flights to over 900 destinations\r\n- Explore the cheapest flights with top airlines\r\n\r\nTRAVEL TOOLS THAT HELP YOU SAVE\r\n- Get notified about deals on flights with push notifications\r\n\r\nHOW TO GET STARTED ON GOING:\r\n1. Start with your airport: Choose any US airport for your departure.\r\n2. Watch the deals roll in: Keep a close eye on plane tickets and price drops.\r\n3. Gather flight details: Access booking links and schedules.\r\n4. Secure your air travel deal and get Going!\r\n\r\nTrial Going for free to start saving hundreds on airfare.\r\n\r\nNever overpay for air travel again. Download now and get Going with cheap flights to your next dream destination!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find travel deals, the cheapest flights and reimagine your next trip with the ultimate vacation travel app. Going lets you discover your next destination \u2014 whether it\u2019s a quick trip or a dream getaway. With affordable flights to over 900 travel destinations around the world, the vacations are endless!<br><br>Save up to 40-90% off flights from your city. No matter where you want to go, Going will help you find flight deals or cheap flights for your next vacation. Explore different travel deals to find flights that work best for you and your budget.<br><br>GOING FEATURES<br><br>FLIGHT DEALS &amp; CHEAP FLIGHTS FOR VACATIONS<br>- Domestic flights can be affordable! Discover the cheapest flights that will help you save on your next getaway<br>- International travel is easy with our in-app globe. Find deals for specific domestic &amp; international destinations<br>- Travel without breaking the bank \u2014 get up to 90% off your next flight<br><br>TRAVEL DEALS &amp; AFFORDABLE FLIGHTS TO TOP DESTINATIONS<br>- Intuitively find travel deals and flights to over 900 destinations<br>- Explore the cheapest flights with top airlines<br><br>TRAVEL TOOLS THAT HELP YOU SAVE<br>- Get notified about deals on flights with push notifications<br><br>HOW TO GET STARTED ON GOING:<br>1. Start with your airport: Choose any US airport for your departure.<br>2. Watch the deals roll in: Keep a close eye on plane tickets and price drops.<br>3. Gather flight details: Access booking links and schedules.<br>4. Secure your air travel deal and get Going!<br><br>Trial Going for free to start saving hundreds on airfare.<br><br>Never overpay for air travel again. Download now and get Going with cheap flights to your next dream destination!",
